    "details": "# Problem Description:\n\nIncorrect packet validation allowed unbounded recursion parsing SCTP\nchunk parameters. This can eventually result in a stack overflow and\npanic.\n\n# Impact:\n\nRemote attackers can craft packets which cause affected systems to\npanic. This affects any system where pf is configured to process\ntraffic, independent of the configured ruleset.\n",
